                "text": "The United States is home to the most caring and united people. Heroes save lives daily\u2014police, firefighters, teachers, medical professionals, and so many others. Quiet acts of service often go unnoticed, but they make our nation strong, resilient, and a beacon of hope. https://t.co/eAxfpp8neG",
