                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Last week, I had the chance to catch up with Sheriff Barnes, Shane Brassell, and some of our hardworking DPS troopers in Hill County. I also stopped by the Waco Family Medicine Clinic in Hillsboro to see the great work they\u2019re doing for the community. https://t.co/4TmeVVALJz",
