                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, I had the opportunity to ask Secretary Kennedy some questions. I was encouraged to hear that the Department of Health and Human Services is working closely with other agencies to rectify past wrongs, that the department's direction is being turned around, and that they're taking ownership of past mistakes and working to correct them moving forward. I appreciate the Secretary's willingness to work with Congress and answer some tough questions. \n\nI left encouraged by progress being made and look forward to continuing an open dialogue with the Secretary.",
